ga64(){return"Nh\u1eadp th\xe0nh \u0111i \u2014 b\xean n\xe0o c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. Ch\u1ea1m v\xe0o Vua r\u1ed3i ch\u1ea1m \xf4 c\xe1ch hai \xf4."},
